{%- comment -%}
  Zo Veilig — cart guard. Ensures a subscription package never sits in the live
  cart without the universal one-time "Activatie en installatie" fee
  (pricing.config.json activation.productHandle/sku).

  The Oplossingen and Vergelijk pakketten add-to-cart flows already add the fee
  alongside a package, but nothing stops it being removed afterwards in the
  cart, or a package reaching the cart through an entry point that doesn't add
  it — e.g. the standalone Shopify product page's default "Toevoegen aan
  winkelwagen" button (Dawn's stock buy-buttons, no custom wiring).

  On every page that renders this, checks the live cart on load: if a
  subscription line exists (product.type == sub_type, the same signal
  zv-cart.liquid/zv-checkout-overview.liquid use — tags aren't reliable here,
  the Cart AJAX API doesn't expose them on line items at all) with no matching
  activation-fee line, it adds the fee and reloads the page. Silent no-op if
  the activation product can't be resolved (activation_variant_id blank) or if
  the add fails (e.g. offline) — the caller is expected to also fail safe
  server-side (see zv-checkout-overview.liquid's cart_needs_activation gate,
  which blocks checkout regardless of whether this script runs or succeeds).

  Params: activation_variant_id, sub_type
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if activation_variant_id != blank -%}
<script>
(function () {
  if (window.__zvCartGuardRan) return;
  window.__zvCartGuardRan = true;
  var ACTIVATION_ID = {{ activation_variant_id | json }};
  var SUB_TYPE = {{ sub_type | json }};
  window.fetch('/cart.js').then(function (r) { return r.json(); }).then(function (cart) {
    var items = (cart && cart.items) || [];
    var hasSub = items.some(function (it) { return it.product_type === SUB_TYPE; });
    var hasActivation = items.some(function (it) { return String(it.variant_id) === String(ACTIVATION_ID); });
    if (hasSub && !hasActivation) {
      return window.fetch('/cart/add.js', {
        method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: ACTIVATION_ID, quantity: 1 }] })
      }).then(function (r) { if (r.ok) window.location.reload(); });
    }
  }).catch(function () { /* fail safe: server-side gate (Overzicht) still blocks checkout */ });
})();
</script>
{%- endif -%}
